 //! `SYMBOL|B:<price>x<size>,<price>x<size>...|A:<price>x<size>,...`
 //! e.g. `BTC-USD|B:101.25x3.0,101.00x1.5|A:101.50x2.0`. Either side may be empty (`B:`).
 
